@startuml
[*] --> Browsing
Browsing --> Analyzing : Analyzing user behavior
Analyzing --> DisplayingRecommendations : Displaying personalized recommendations
DisplayingRecommendations --> ViewingDetails : User clicks on recommendation
ViewingDetails --> Rating : User rates product
Rating --> DisplayingSummary : Displaying ratings summary
DisplayingSummary --> [*] : Process completes
DisplayingSummary --> Browsing : Continue browsing
@enduml
